1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,860
 many of my earliest primary classes

2
00:00:03,860 --> 00:00:05,760
 were held beneath the shade of a mango tree

3
00:00:05,760 --> 00:00:07,860
 our teachers faithfully

4
00:00:07,860 --> 00:00:08,900
 prepared each lesson

5
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:10,820
 but what I remember most

6
00:00:10,820 --> 00:00:12,600
 is how they loved us

7
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:14,420
 they knew us personally

8
00:00:14,420 --> 00:00:15,880
 even by name

9
00:00:15,880 --> 00:00:19,580
 their love helped us feel the Savior's love

10
00:00:19,580 --> 00:00:21,300
 and feeling His love

11
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:23,540
 helped us feel the truth of His gospel

12
00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:25,680
 and looking back

13
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:27,560
 I realized that my parents

14
00:00:27,560 --> 00:00:29,140
 and my church teachers

15
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:31,240
 were following the pattern of the master teacher

16
00:00:31,240 --> 00:00:34,340
 because the impact of a gospel teacher

17
00:00:34,340 --> 00:00:36,220
 is not just the message.

18
00:00:37,020 --> 00:00:38,520
 It is the love of the messenger.

19
00:00:40,460 --> 00:00:42,940
 My wife and I will always cherish our time

20
00:00:42,940 --> 00:00:43,800
 in the Australia City.

